# Milestone DAG Extraction — Minimal Prompt

## Inputs
- repo_git_path: {{repo_git_path}}
- start_tag: {{start_tag}}
- end_tag: {{end_tag}}

## Task
- Identify a concise set of milestones (3–10) and directed dependencies (edges) that describe the project’s evolution within the given time window.
- Prefer tool-driven evidence (commits, PRs, file co-change) when available; otherwise, provide short rationale.

## Tools (if available)
- MCP tools
- Local git commands within repo_git_path

## Outputs
- {{result_path}}/milestones.csv
  - Columns: id,title
- {{result_path}}/dependencies.csv
  - Columns: prerequisite_id,dependant_id

## Notes
- If tools are unavailable, continue with a fallback method and note assumptions succinctly.
- Keep outputs UTF-8, newline as "\n".

